  "limitations": [
    "Independent unbuilt source queue only, preserving one real root commit and all nine files. Three public report images, two official cover images, two source metadata files, review and payload manifest. No model, new model stage, rendering, or completed new scene.",
    "All three report images are1192x671; both official covers are1008x630. These are frozen public report/cover pixels, not native decoded video frames. Within-video times, native resolution and4K availability are unproved. Image09song identity remains unknown.",
    "Frozen official page records identify BV1Vh4y1G7ZZ (YO!, posted2023-06-09) and BV1VW4y1Q76a (Tong, posted2023-06-15), both referring to the2023-05-27livestream BV1jm4y147Cv. June upload dates are not evidence of later performance reuse. Source year2018is an article chapter label, not the recording date.",
    "The producer reports bounded local visual bridges between08andYO! and12andTong; neither exact-frame identity nor a new unobstructed wide-side structural baseline is established. Image09wardrobe and08/12lighting differences do not prove constant geometry. The left screen person in12is media content, not a second camera.",
    "Overall outer boundary, rear/bottom ring geometry, hidden supports and static-state compatibility remain unresolved. Limited comparisons to prior festival/keyring material are producer observations; this archive operation neither repeats external comparisons nor claims exhaustive old-scene deduplication or accepted reconstruction eligibility.",
    "Two recorded searches and HTML5 playback limitations are preserved as evidence. No webpage, blocked playback endpoint, unrelated images or producer scripts are fetched or executed by the archive worker. Source content is preserved without editorial correction.",
    "New independent research archive/history refs preserve the real source history. Every preexisting archive path and remote ref, including all cyber-roof production and experiment refs and R05CURRENT, stays unchanged. Only official Library reception, ordinary Git and integrity checks occur; no LFS, force push, credential copying, security changes, Issues or PRs. Previously denied source-screening-increment receipt remains paused. Spaceversion0is retained pending parent consumption confirmation."
